  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Runs GraphBin in the browser to refine an initial contig binning along the assembly graph, then lets the researcher see why each contig was placed where it was, correct contigs that look wrong, re-run the refinement and export the curated bins and plots. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
